2026-07-27T12:35:13.4636941Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:35:13.4637521Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:35:13.4638008Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:35:13.4638711Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:35:13.4639429Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
